title = SIG SG 550
description = The SIG SG 550 is an assault rifle manufactured by SIG Sauer AG in Switzerland. "SG" is an abbreviation for Sturmgewehr. The SG 550 was co-developed by SIG Sauer AG and the Italian firearm manufacturer Beretta; it is based on its predecessor, the SIG SG 540, chambered in 5.56×45mm NATO.
